Value Required ADDRESS (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value TALLY ([*#+\-x ]?~?)
Value REF_CLOCK (\S+)
Value STRATUM (\d+)
Value WHEN (\S+)
Value POLL (\d+)
Value REACH (\d+)
Value DELAY (\S+)
Value OFFSET (\S+)
Value DISP (\S+)

Start
  ^\s+address\s+ref clock -> Servers

Servers
  ^${TALLY}${ADDRESS}\s+${REF_CLOCK}\s+${STRATUM}\s+${WHEN}\s+${POLL}\s+${REACH}\s+${DELAY}\s+${OFFSET}\s+${DISP}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s+\*\s+sys\.peer
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error
